NOTE ON THE COMPLIANCE OUTPUT

This software produces indicative findings and maps them to statutory
provisions for relevance. The statutory text bundled in
kryxai/compliance/sources.json is marked UNVERIFIED_IN_THIS_BUILD and must be
verified against the Gazette by a qualified lawyer. KryxAI is not legal advice
and produces no compliance determination. Use of the output in a filing, notice
or regulatory communication is at the operator's own risk.
